# Building structure with the typed creation keys in one go: os adds a section below, It a first-child task, An a note at the start of the list, and ap a project at the end.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys j os
type Later
keys <Esc> It
type Archive old drafts
keys <Esc> An
type Top note
keys <Esc> G ap
type Bulk
keys <Esc>
see ▌     Bulk:
see       - Archive old drafts
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	Later @section
		Top note
		- Archive old drafts
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
		Bulk:
END
